Short source-landscape note: the 2023 DRC welfare-source universe is dominated by UN agency reporting, World Bank program and diagnostics material, government education and health communications, and human-rights / humanitarian reporting on displacement, food insecurity, service access, and protection. The strongest document families so far are the DRC DHS/EDS, UNICEF/UNESCO education and child-welfare reports, WHO health-system mappings, WFP/FAO food-security and emergency briefs, World Bank project and poverty diagnostics, UNFPA maternal/reproductive health reporting, and HRW/UNHCR displacement/protection reporting.

